    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 20, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——监狱生活第二轮，第二天。<br>\n玛格被看守攻击，身负重伤。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv10_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 22, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——原因是艾玛、雪莉、汉娜三人<br>\n策划越狱并反抗看守。<br>\n玛格被卷入其中。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv10_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 24, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——我和蕾雅、梅露露在医务室<br>\n照料玛格。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv10_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 26, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——其他囚犯也轮流<br>\n来探望玛格。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv10_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——玛格一度发高烧，生命垂危，<br>\n但在梅露露的魔法下好转，状况已稳定。<br>\n不用再担心了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv10_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——虽然是以我不愿意看到的方式，<br>\n至少看守的危险性已为众人所知。<br>\n少女们都变得畏缩了起来。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv10_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "——为防止再次有人策划越狱，<br>\n我决定每天定时检查各个关押囚犯的房间。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0201Adv10_Narrative007"]}},
